# Placeholder for the Authelia storage encryption key file (Docker secret).
#
# The real secrets/authelia-storage.secret is git-ignored and generated by
# scripts/bootstrap-secrets.sh with: openssl rand -hex 64
# compose/ai-node.yml mounts it at /run/secrets/authelia_storage_secret and
# points AUTHELIA_STORAGE_ENCRYPTION_KEY_FILE at it. Never change it after
# Authelia's first start: it encrypts data in the Authelia database.
replace-with-openssl-rand-hex-64-output
